     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: PlanDefinition SufficientFeeding</b></p><a name=\"SufficientFeeding\"> </a><a name=\"hcSufficientFeeding\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"https://www.netzwerk-universitaetsmedizin.de/fhir/cpg-on-ebm-on-fhir/StructureDefinition-recommendation-plan.html\">Recommendation Plan</a></p></div><p><b>partOf</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-DIVIQualityIndicator7.html\">DIVI Quality Indicator 7</a></p><blockquote><p><b>Action Combination Method</b></p><ul><li>method: <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.netzwerk-universitaetsmedizin.de/fhir/cpg-on-ebm-on-fhir/CodeSystem/cs-action-combination-method all}\">All</span></li></ul></blockquote><p><b>knowledgeCapability</b>: computable</p><p><b>knowledgeRepresentationLevel</b>: structured</p><p><b>url</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-SufficientFeeding.html\">PlanDefinition Sufficient Feeding in Non-Adipose Patients</a></p><p><b>version</b>: 1.0</p><p><b>name</b>: Intervention_SufficientFeeding</p><p><b>title</b>: Sufficient Feeding in Non-Adipose Patients</p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type eca-rule}\">ECA Rule</span></p><p><b>status</b>: Active</p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"EvidenceVariable-IntensiveCarePatients-ClinicallyFed-NoAdipositas.html\">Population: Intensive Care Patients that are clinically fed and have no Adipositas</a></p><p><b>date</b>: 2024-03-29</p><p><b>description</b>: </p><div><p>Every day, all Non-Adipose Intensive Care Patients should receive the amount of Calories that match their daily individual requirements.</p>\n</div><blockquote><p><b>goal</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>sufficient-feeding</blockquote><p><b>category</b>: <span title